 the new outline preset which creates a material with `Read` and `Write` enabled. But when I saved the material and adjusted it, the flags suddenly stopped me from enabling this combination again, instead only enabling `Read`.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, the flag state can now be set to:\r\n- Each flag individually enabled\r\n- `Read` and `Write`\r\n- `Read` and `Write Depth Fail`\r\n- `Write` and `Write Depth Fail`\r\n\r\nI believe my change simply added the `Read` and `Write` combination. And so these should be the valid states of the flag, but please let me know if any of them are invalid!","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-20T14:52:08Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T01:33:00Z","closed_at":"2025-06-22T09:35:11Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fa854f4f1040ab8ebfd95a393387faefc3594c73","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Randehh:fix-stencil-mask-combinations","ref":"fix-stencil-mask-combinations","repo":{"id":1005617244,"node_id":"R_kgDOO_CAXA","name":"godot","full_name":"Randehh/godot","owner":{"login":"Randehh","id":831493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMTQ5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/831493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Randehh","html_ur